From c3d1f7fcd7f468a4e82d9791da61d59c77aac3fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: steamac <steamac@local>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:55:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 55/57] Keep RDR2 query pools alive without advertising
 statistics

STEAMAC-AG/G: invalid disabled-feature statistics pools return zero lanes with real availability. Split native timestamps into 4096-sample Metal buffers; preserve CPU fallback under process budget pressure. sentry_ag checks host and Venus-style GPU reads, resets, unavailable queries, and cross-buffer direct/compute resolves.
